	(text "ILIM / ICHG (70 mA) / SYS_REG / ship mode set over I2C: register init per dial-me-spinner docs/firmware.md §13.1.\nIN 2.2u/25V X7R 0805, SYS 10u/25V, BAT 4.7u: each within 1 mm of its ball and of the D2 GND ball.\nShip mode exits only on a USB plug-in (TS/MR is not wired to a button in rev A).\n/INT -> CHG_INT_N (10k pull-up R8, GPIO3). RT1: 10k NTC next to J2 (board temperature, not the cell)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 275.59 19.05 0)
		(effects
